            "text": "{\"packet_id\":\"B025\",\"decisions\":[{\"criterion\":\"Input/expected-output schema\",\"label\":\"partially-documented\",\"evidence_refs\":[{\"source_id\":\"E001\",\"line_start\":81,\"line_end\":105},{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":51,\"line_end\":88},{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":144,\"line_end\":161}],\"evidence_note\":\"README describes prediction JSON with model_name and prediction; eval code shows required fields like qtype, qsubtype, instruction_type, answer, parsed_result with parsed_prediction/Parse@1/ecr_1, but full dataset schema and parsed_result format are not fully specified.\",\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"criterion\":\"Metric definition\",\"label\":\"partially-documented\",\"evidence_refs\":[{\"source_id\":\"E001\",\"line_start\":52,\"line_end\":77},{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":6,\"line_end\":29}],\"evidence_note\":\"README and eval script docstring map task types to metrics (EM, EM_with_error_10, ROUGE-L, Pass@1) and give high-level descriptions, but do not precisely define EM, EM_with_error_10 computation or ROUGE-L variant and aggregation.\",\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"criterion\":\"Evaluator implementation available\",\"label\":\"partially-documented\",\"evidence_refs\":[{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":1,\"line_end\":4},{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":93,\"line_end\":151},{\"source_id\":\"E003\",\"line_start\":1,\"line_end\":11}],\"evidence_note\":\"Evaluation pipeline for merging, grouping, and aggregating results is implemented, but the core metric class metrics.qa_metrics.QAMetric and utilities (file I/O, parsing) are only imported, not shown, so the full evaluator cannot be reconstructed.\",\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"criterion\":\"Grading rules & tie-breaking\",\"label\":\"partially-documented\",\"evidence_refs\":[{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":119,\"line_end\":161},{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":225,\"line_end\":267}],\"evidence_note\":\"Scripts show how scores are aggregated (metric_eval_engine.compute, counts, totals, percentages rounded to two decimals). However, there is no documentation on leaderboard ranking, tie-breaking policy, or how multiple metrics are combined for final rankings.\",\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"criterion\":\"Predictions->aggregate-score mapping\",\"label\":\"partially-documented\",\"evidence_refs\":[{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":119,\"line_end\":151},{\"source_id\":\"E002\",\"line_start\":225,\"line_end\":260}],\"evidence_note\":\"Code shows mapping from per-instance parsed_result and answer to aggregate metrics via QAMetric.compute and counts for Parse@1/ECR@1/Pass@1, but the internal aggregation behavior of QAMetric (e.g., averaging, weighting) is not visible.\",\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"criterion\":\"Sample predictions / trajectories\",\"label\":\"claimed-but-not-verifiable\",\"evidence_refs\":[{\"source_id\":\"E001\",\"line_start\":95,\"line_end\":106}],\"evidence_note\":\"README points to an example inference result file in eval_examples/inference_results, but its contents are not included in the provided evidence, so example predictions/trajectories cannot be inspected here.\",\"confidence\":\"high\"}]}"
